
# Microservices Interview Questions & Answers

## 30 Real-World Scenario-Based Questions for Java Developers

**Level:** 3–7 Years Experience\
**Topics:** Microservices, Kafka, RabbitMQ, Spring Boot, Distributed Systems, Scalability, Resilience, Database Management

